    ## story_prologue.rpy - Narration and dialogue
    old "Semuanya berawal dari sebuah senja yang basah oleh hujan es dan kabut kelabu di kota tua Ashwood."
    new "It all began on an evening drenched in sleet and grey mist in the old town of Ashwood."

    old "Kota kecil di kaki lembah terpencil itu tampak suram, tua, dan seakan tertidur dalam pelukan bayang-bayang bukit granit hitam yang menjulang angkuh menantang langit."
    new "The small town at the foot of a remote valley looked bleak, ancient, and as though it slumbered in the embrace of towering black granite hills that loomed defiantly against the sky."

    old "Jalanan berbatu sempit digenangi air berlumpur bercampur salju mencair, memantulkan temaram cahaya lentera minyak kuning dari kedai penginapan tua {i}'The Black Crow'{/i}."
    new "The narrow cobblestone streets were flooded with muddy water mixed with melting snow, reflecting the dim yellow glow of oil lanterns from the old tavern, {i}'The Black Crow'{/i}."

    old "Angin musim dingin melolong liar di antara atap-atap seng dan cerobong bata merah yang menghitam, meniupkan bau jelaga basah, tembakau kasar, dan lumut rawa ke dalam lorong-lorong kota yang sunyi tanpa pejalan kaki."
    new "The winter wind howled wildly among the tin roofs and soot-blackened red brick chimneys, carrying the scent of wet soot, rough tobacco, and marsh moss into the town's deserted alleyways."

    old "Di dalam kedai yang beraroma kayu ek basah, tembakau pipa, dan rebusan daging domba berempah, aku duduk sendirian di sudut perapian batu besar."
    new "Inside the tavern, fragrant with wet oak, pipe tobacco, and spiced lamb stew, I sat alone in the corner by the great stone hearth."

    old "Di atas meja kayu ek yang penuh goresan pisau dan noda tumpahan ale, sepucuk surat bersampul perkamen tebal terbaring di samping cangkir tembaga berisi bir hitamku."
    new "Upon the oak table, scarred with knife marks and stained with spilled ale, a letter in a thick parchment envelope lay beside my copper mug of dark beer."

    old "Segel lilin merah darah berbentuk bunga mawar mekar dengan duri-duri tajam tampak begitu mencolok di bawah pantulan lidah api perapian."
    new "A blood-red wax seal in the shape of a rose in full bloom, ringed with sharp thorns, stood out strikingly beneath the dancing firelight."

    old "Tulisan tangan di atas amplop itu diukir dengan tinta besi empedu hitam yang anggun, meliuk-liuk membentuk kaligrafi bangsawan era Victoria yang sempurna."
    new "The handwriting upon the envelope was inscribed in elegant iron gall ink, flowing into the perfect aristocratic calligraphy of the Victorian age."

    old "Ketik nama Anda (tekan Enter untuk memakai nama bawaan 'Guest'):"
    new "Enter your name (press Enter to use the default 'Guest'):"

    old "Nama '[mc_name]' tertera jelas di atas permukaan perkamen yang berbau wangi mawar samar."
    new "The name '[mc_name]' was inscribed clearly upon the parchment, which carried the faint scent of roses."

    old "Di dalam surat itu tertulis kalimat singkat yang menghantui pikiranku sejak tiba di pos pos kereta api perbatasan:"
    new "Within the letter, a brief passage had haunted my thoughts ever since I arrived at the border railway station:"

    old "{i}'Kepada Tuan [mc_name]... Hutang masa lalu yang terlupakan menanti penebusan di balik dinding-dinding Rose Manor. Datanglah sebelum musim dingin mengunci lembah selamanya, atau biarkan ingatan keluargamu musnah ditelan ketiadaan.'{/i}"
    new "{i}'To Mr. [mc_name]... A forgotten debt of the past awaits redemption behind the walls of Rose Manor. Come before winter seals the valley forever, or let the memory of your family perish into oblivion.'{/i}"

    old "Lelaki tua pemilik kedai melangkah mendekat dengan celemek kain linen cokelat kotor, membawakan semangkuk sup kentang panas dan sepotong roti gandum hitam."
    new "The old innkeeper approached in his soiled brown linen apron, bearing a bowl of hot potato soup and a slice of dark rye bread."

    old "Namun begitu pandangannya jatuh ke atas segel lilin mawar merah di atas mejaku, langkahnya mendadak membeku kaku di tempat."
    new "But the moment his gaze fell upon the red rose wax seal on my table, he froze mid-step."

    old "Mangkuk sup di tangannya bergetar hebat hingga kuah panasnya tumpah membasahi lantai kayu cemara."
    new "The soup bowl in his hands trembled so violently that the hot broth spilled across the spruce wood floor."

    old "Segel lilin itu... mawar berduri keluarga Rosewood..."
    new "That wax seal... the thorned rose of House Rosewood..."

    old "Kau mengenali lambang ini, Tuan Pemilik Kedai?"
    new "You recognise this crest, sir?"

    old "Lelaki tua itu menoleh ke kanan dan kiri dengan cemas, memastikan para pelanggan lain di sudut kedai tidak mendengar percakapan kami."
    new "The old man glanced nervously left and right, ensuring the other patrons in the far corner could not overhear us."

    old "Para peminum dan pemburu di meja seberang mendadak bungkam seribu bahasa. Mereka melirik sekilas ke arah amplop surat di hadapanku dengan mata membelalak ketakutan, lalu buru-buru menundukkan kepala, berbisik-bisik panik, dan menggeser bangku kayu mereka menjauh dari mejaku."
    new "The drinkers and hunters at the opposite table fell deathly silent. They glanced at the envelope before me with wide, fearful eyes, then hastily lowered their heads, whispering in panic as they slid their wooden benches further from my table."

    old "Pemilik kedai membungkuk rendah ke arahku, meletakkan mangkuk sup dengan tangan yang masih gemetar hebat, lalu berbicara dengan bisikan serak yang sarat ketakutan murni."
    new "The innkeeper leaned low toward me, setting down the soup with hands still trembling fiercely, and spoke in a hoarse whisper saturated with pure dread."

    old "Tuan muda... jika Anda masih menghargai keselamatan nyawa, masa depan, dan kewarasan akal budi Anda... lemparkan surat itu ke dalam perapian ini sekarang juga."
    new "Young sir... if you still value the safety of your life, your future, and the soundness of your mind... cast that letter into the hearth this very instant."

    old "Jangan pernah melangkah mendekati lembah kabut Rose Manor."
    new "Never set foot near the misty valley of Rose Manor."

    old "Menanyakan alasan mendalam mengapa seluruh penduduk kota begitu ketakutan pada Rose Manor"
    new "Ask why the entire town is so terrified of Rose Manor"

    old "Mengapa seluruh kota ini seolah membeku setiap kali nama Rose Manor disebut? Apa yang sebenarnya terjadi di atas bukit itu?"
    new "Why does this entire town seem to freeze every time Rose Manor is mentioned? What truly happened upon that hill?"

    old "Lembah itu terkutuk sejak seratus lima puluh tahun yang lalu, Tuan."
    new "That valley has been cursed for a hundred and fifty years, sir."

    old "Setiap beberapa tahun sekali, surat undangan bersegel mawar darah itu dikirimkan ke berbagai penjuru negeri."
    new "Every few years, invitations bearing the blood-rose seal are dispatched to every corner of the land."

    old "Para pelancong terhormat, seniman berbakat, sarjana universitas, dan pemuda bangsawan datang menunggangi kereta pos dengan rasa penasaran yang membara."
    new "Distinguished travellers, gifted artists, university scholars, and young noblemen arrive by mail coach, burning with curiosity."

    old "Dan tidak ada satu pun dari mereka yang pernah kembali seperti sedia kala!"
    new "And not a single one of them has ever returned the same as they were!"

    old "Jika ada yang beruntung ditemukan hidup di pinggir jalan hutan Ashwood beberapa pekan kemudian... mereka ditemukan dalam keadaan linglung tanpa ingatan sedikit pun."
    new "Those fortunate enough to be found alive by the forest road weeks later... were discovered in a daze, stripped of every last memory."

    old "Mereka melupakan nama orang tua mereka, melupakan wajah kekasih mereka, dan bahkan tidak tahu siapa nama mereka sendiri ketika ditanya oleh pendeta desa."
    new "They forgot their parents' names, forgot their lovers' faces, and could not even recall their own names when questioned by the village priest."

    old "Tempat itu bukan sekadar rumah bangsawan, Tuan... Orang-orang tua di lembah ini menjulukinya {i}'Makam Kenangan'{/i}."
    new "That place is no mere nobleman's house, sir... The elders of this valley call it {i}'The Grave of Memories'{/i}."

    old "Rumah itu memakan ingatan manusia laksana binatang buas memakan daging segar!"
    new "That house devours human memories as a wild beast devours fresh flesh!"

    old "Menanyakan siapa sosok yang saat ini menguasai Rose Manor"
    new "Ask who currently resides at Rose Manor"

    old "Siapa yang menjadi tuan tanah di Rose Manor saat ini? Surat ini ditandatangani atas nama wangsa Rosewood."
    new "Who presides over Rose Manor at present? This letter bears the signature of House Rosewood."

    old "Hanya seorang nona bangsawan muda bernama Nona Seraphina Rosewood... dan seorang kepala pelayan wanita yang konon tidak pernah menua."
    new "Only a young noblewoman by the name of Miss Seraphina Rosewood... and a head maid who, they say, has never aged."

    old "Nona Seraphina jarang sekali menampakkan dirinya di kota ini. Terakhir kali ia terlihat di pasar bunga lima tahun lalu saat musim gugur."
    new "Miss Seraphina rarely shows herself in this town. She was last seen at the flower market five autumns ago."

    old "Wajahnya cantik jelita laksana patung pualam katedral, rambutnya seputih perak murni, namun matanya... sepasang matanya merah pekat bagai anggur tua."
    new "Her face was beautiful beyond words, like a cathedral's marble statue; her hair as white as pure silver; but her eyes... a pair of eyes as deeply red as aged wine."

    old "Orang-orang mengatakan bahwa garis keturunan Rosewood terikat oleh kutukan perjanjian darah kuno yang menuntut tumbal emosi manusia pada setiap generasi."
    new "People say the Rosewood bloodline is bound by the curse of an ancient blood pact, one that demands a sacrificial offering of human emotion with every generation."

    old "Gadis itu tidak pernah tersenyum kepada siapa pun. Di balik kecantikannya yang memikat, ada hawa kematian yang membekukan darah siapa pun yang memandangnya."
    new "That girl has never smiled at a living soul. Behind her bewitching beauty lies the cold aura of death, one that chills the blood of anyone who beholds her."

    old "Menegaskan tekad membaja bahwa aku harus pergi demi mengungkap misteri masa lalu keluargaku"
    new "Declare my iron resolve to go and uncover the mysteries of my family's past"

    old "Aku tidak bisa memutar balik arah, Tuan. Surat ini menyinggung masa lalu keluargaku yang sengaja dihapus dari sejarah."
    new "I cannot turn back, sir. This letter alludes to my family's past, a past deliberately erased from history."

    old "Aku harus pergi ke Rose Manor untuk memahami siapa diriku yang sebenarnya dan hutang apa yang menuntut darahku."
    new "I must go to Rose Manor to understand who I truly am and what debt demands my blood."

    old "Keberanian yang membuta sering kali merupakan pintu gerbang tercepat menuju liang kubur, Tuan muda."
    new "Blind courage is often the swiftest gateway to the grave, young sir."

    old "Namun jika tekad Anda sudah sekeras batu granit purba di puncak gunung... saya hanya bisa berdoa agar malaikat menjaga jiwa Anda dari kegelapan lembah mawar."
    new "But if your resolve is already as hard as the primordial granite upon the mountaintop... I can only pray the angels guard your soul against the darkness of the rose valley."

    old "Jangan pernah meminum anggur di rumah itu, jangan pernah menyentuh mawar di taman malam mereka, dan berdoalah agar Anda masih diizinkan melihat fajar kembali."
    new "Never drink the wine in that house, never touch the roses in their midnight garden, and pray that you are still permitted to see the dawn again."

    old "Tepat ketika pemilik kedai menyelesaikan peringatannya, pintu ganda kedai terhempas terbuka lebar oleh tiupan angin badai yang menderu dahsyat."
    new "Just as the innkeeper finished his warning, the tavern's double doors were flung wide open by a thundering gust of storm wind."

    old "Hawa dingin bersalju menyapu masuk ke dalam ruangan, memadamkan beberapa lilin di meja makan dan membuat kobaran api perapian mendesis liar."
    new "A wave of frigid, snow-laden air swept into the room, snuffing out several candles on the dining tables and sending the hearth fire hissing wildly."

