    new "The coachman's hoarse voice came cold from behind the front window."

    old "Perjanjian melarang keretaku melintasi gerbang besi ini. Jika Anda ingin menuju Rose Manor... langkahkan kaki Anda melewati jalan setapak di hadapan Anda."
    new "The pact forbids my carriage from crossing this iron gate. If you wish to reach Rose Manor... walk the path that lies before you."

    old "Aku membuka pintu kereta dan melangkah turun ke atas tanah berbatu kerikil yang diselimuti lapisan es tipis."
    new "I opened the carriage door and stepped down onto the gravelled earth, coated in a thin layer of ice."

    old "Dan tepat di hadapanku... terbentang pemandangan yang membuat napas di tenggorokanku tercekat sesaat."
