    old "Gerbang itu berdiri setengah terbuka, mengeluarkan derit logam panjang yang ngilu saat angin malam berhembus melaluinya."
    new "The gate stood half open, emitting a long, agonising metallic creak as the night wind passed through it."

    old "Di balik gerbang, jalan setapak berbatu marmer putih meliuk menaiki bukit di antara semak-semak mawar liar yang kering dan menghitam."
    new "Beyond the gate, a white marble path wound up the hillside between withered and blackened wild rose bushes."

    old "Dan di puncak bukit granit kelabu itu... berdiri Rose Manor."
    new "And upon the crest of that grey granite hill... stood Rose Manor."

    old "Mansion gotik raksasa itu menjulang megah sekaligus menyeramkan laksana benteng kuno yang menantang langit malam."
    new "The colossal Gothic mansion loomed majestic yet terrifying, like an ancient fortress defying the night sky."

    old "Menara-menara lancip beratap batu sabak hitam mencakar awan badai kelabu, sementara jendela-jendela berkaca patri lengkung memantulkan cahaya petir yang menyambar di kejauhan langit."
    new "Spired towers capped with black slate clawed at the grey storm clouds, while arched stained-glass windows reflected the lightning that struck in the distant heavens."

    old "Hanya ada satu jendela di lantai dua yang memancarkan pendaran cahaya lilin keemasan yang hangat dan temaram."
    new "Only a single second-floor window radiated the warm, dim glow of golden candlelight."

    old "Di belakangku, suara pecutan cambuk terdengar keras membelah malam."
    new "Behind me, the sharp crack of a whip split the night."

    old "Kereta kuda hitam itu memutar arah dengan tergesa-gesa dan melesat pergi meninggalkan gerbang, menghilang ke dalam pekatnya kabut hutan tanpa menoleh ke belakang sedikit pun."
    new "The black carriage wheeled about in haste and sped away from the gate, vanishing into the forest's dense fog without so much as a backward glance."

    old "Kini, aku berdiri sendirian di depan gerbang mawar berduri."
    new "Now I stood alone before the gate of thorned roses."

    old "Tidak ada jalan untuk kembali. Hutan Ashwood telah tertutup oleh badai di belakangku, dan satu-satunya jalan menuju kebenaran adalah melangkah melewati gerbang besi ini."
    new "There was no way back. Ashwood Forest had sealed itself behind me in the storm, and the only path to the truth lay through this iron gate."

